OL,4,CArsenal elite on another level       W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GIt is only 18 months since Arsenal   W5
OL,7,Gtasted European glory, but they are  W5
OL,8,Gnot a team on many people's list of  W5
OL,9,Gfavourites for this season's Women's W5
OL,10,GChampions League.                    W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,GThat is because not only have the    W5
OL,13,GGunners disappointed across their    W5
OL,14,Gopening 15 matches of the season,    W5
OL,15,Gbut also the elite teams in Europe   W5
OL,16,Gseem to have gone up another level.  W5
OL,17,                                      W5
OL,18,GIn the space of seven days, Arsenal  W5
OL,19,Ghave witnessed first hand what it    W5
OL,20,Gtakes to reach those heights - and   W5
OL,21,Gthe gap they must bridge.            W5
OL,22,                                      W5
